{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker","title":"Pemisahan Maker dan Checker dalam Verifikasi AI","description":"Prinsip bahwa entitas yang mengimplementasikan solusi tidak boleh menjadi entitas yang memvalidasi kebenarannya untuk menghindari self-justification.","tags":["ai-verification","engineering-discipline","testing"],"created":1781158953088,"updated":1781161780979,"custom":{"description":"Prinsip bahwa entitas yang mengimplementasikan solusi tidak boleh menjadi entitas yang memvalidasi kebenarannya untuk menghindari self-justification."},"fname":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"5181cc8cf0c46b26e7cb1be81d88ae32","desc":"","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker","id":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai-verification","alias":"ai-verification","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai-verification"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker","id":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.engineering-discipline","alias":"engineering-discipline","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.engineering-discipline"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker","id":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.testing","alias":"testing","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.testing"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker","id":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.ai-engineering.allen-holub-approach","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":3,"offset":1067},"end":{"line":17,"column":48,"offset":1112},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.ai-engineering.allen-holub-approach"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker","id":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.ai-engineering.loop-engineering","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":3,"offset":1185},"end":{"line":18,"column":44,"offset":1226},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.ai-engineering.loop-engineering"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.the-oracle-problem","id":"zettel.ai.the-oracle-problem","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":3,"offset":1249},"end":{"line":20,"column":48,"offset":1294},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker"},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.verified-done","id":"zettel.ai.verified-done","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":3,"offset":992},"end":{"line":19,"column":48,"offset":1037},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker"}],"anchors":{"konsep":{"type":"header","text":"Konsep","value":"konsep","line":15,"column":0,"depth":2},"prinsip-utama":{"type":"header","text":"Prinsip Utama","value":"prinsip-utama","line":18,"column":0,"depth":2},"implementasi-praktis":{"type":"header","text":"Implementasi Praktis","value":"implementasi-praktis","line":24,"column":0,"depth":2},"relasi":{"type":"header","text":"Relasi","value":"relasi","line":29,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"5u5qgf55dk7a3bauxh68b69","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"pemisahan-maker-dan-checker-dalam-verifikasi-ai\">Pemisahan Maker dan Checker dalam Verifikasi AI<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#pemisahan-maker-dan-checker-dalam-verifikasi-ai\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"konsep\">Konsep<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#konsep\"></a></h2>\n<p>Dalam pengembangan software menggunakan AI, terdapat risiko besar bernama <strong>self-justification</strong>, di mana AI yang menulis kode juga menulis test-nya. Hasilnya, AI cenderung membuat test yang hanya memvalidasi bahwa kodenya \"jalan\" (pass), bukan memvalidasi bahwa kodenya \"benar\" sesuai behavior domain.</p>\n<h2 id=\"prinsip-utama\">Prinsip Utama<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#prinsip-utama\"></a></h2>\n<p>Untuk mendapatkan verifikasi yang valid, harus ada pemisahan tegas antara <strong>Maker</strong> (yang mengimplementasikan) dan <strong>Checker</strong> (yang memvalidasi).</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Maker</strong>: AI yang mengimplementasikan fitur/komponen.</li>\n<li><strong>Checker</strong>: Manusia (atau sistem deterministik/model judge yang berbeda) yang menentukan kriteria keberhasilan.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"implementasi-praktis\">Implementasi Praktis<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#implementasi-praktis\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>TDD dengan AI</strong>: Manusia menulis test (Checker) <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> AI menulis kode (Maker) <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Test memverifikasi.</li>\n<li><strong>Deterministic First</strong>: Gunakan validator JSON, test suite, atau OpenAPI spec sebelum menggunakan model judge.</li>\n<li><strong>Boundary Control</strong>: Test harus fokus pada behavior domain (apa yang dilakukan), bukan detail implementasi (bagaimana itu dilakukan).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"relasi\">Relasi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#relasi\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.ai-engineering.allen-holub-approach\">AI as Engineering Accelerator, Not Replacement: Allen Holub's Approach</a>: Implementasi keras dari prinsip ini dengan melarang AI menulis test.</li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">notes.ai-engineering.loop-engineering (Private)</a>: Kebutuhan akan verifier dalam loop untuk menghindari loop abadi atau hasil sampah.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai-verification (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">engineering-discipline (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">testing (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.ai.the-oracle-problem\">The Oracle Problem dalam AI Coding</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.ai.verified-done\">Definisi 'Done' sebagai 'Verified'</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy"